&quot; and the &quot;Washing Machine&quot; spirit\u2014he was filled with guilt, lost all his powers, and became an ordinary person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five years later, after reuniting with a college classmate, the hiding place of the &quot;Washing Machine&quot; spirit has been found. Can you recover your friend, restore your powers, and make up for past regrets? Even if you do, some things may never return to how they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Interaction</strong>: Freely explore real residential buildings and the &quot;Washing Machine&quot; realm, talk to different characters, and advance the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth &amp; Combat</strong>: Gain &quot;Dream Sources&quot; through story progression and exploration to activate divine skills. Use your reflexes and insight to defeat various monsters with different forms and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111440/extras/a33b3335935ba0b2187f14f3a129314c.avif?t=1767791403\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["NumbtMK"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111440/e0746b34f49f87e040af6c89b0ef966efe155671/header.jpg?t=1767791403","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game uses the \"CLFN\" font, Copyright (C) 1988 Institute of Software, Chinese Academy of Sciences, 1989 Sony Corporation, 2024 DWNfonts. It is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll assets (excluding music, sound effects, and third-party fonts) are original creations of the developer. Unauthorized extraction, decompilation, or redistribution of these as